    "curriculumContext": "The 2026–2027 Music and Society example includes the 120 EC major and 60 EC of profiling. It uses the standard 7.5 EC thesis.",
    "ucrCourseEvidence": "Film and Text analyzes film music; Media Archaeology examines sound fidelity and recording technologies; Native American Histories includes analysis of contemporary music and artistic expression; Creative Communication Laboratory explores sonic poetry and performance. Film, documentary, sociology and museum studies support related interpretation, production and research. The available course content does not build cumulative study of musical works, theory, listening, music history or musicological methods.",
